{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cg31ycWAzE1794612629.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有美國聯邦儲備局官員暗示，聯儲局下月將會加息。</p><p></p><p>芝加哥聯邦儲備銀行行長古爾斯比，接受財經頻道《CNBC》訪問時表示，對最新的通脹數據感憂慮，相信聯儲局肯定要作出行動，以持續建立公信力。他指出，通脹率已經高於聯儲局百分之2的目標近6年，雖然有時見到進展，但最近就無任何改善，甚至往錯誤方向發展。古爾斯比並非聯儲局議息會議的投票委員，但明年將取得投票權。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.261758+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T22:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T09:16:05.479808+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:50:23.272765+00:00","content_hash":"b1e975812a74e662818d9cd736dcfd62433abab9d8193aa54bdfe7858362fe32","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}